{"title": "Lethal Weapon (Slashing)", "pageid": 27992, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Lethal_Weapon_(Slashing)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Lethal Weapon</b> is a passive feature that bypasses defenses against slashing damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon ignores <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Slashing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f0/Slashing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Slashing\" title=\"Slashing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/92/Adamantine_Longsword_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Longsword\" title=\"Adamantine Longsword\">Adamantine Longsword</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scimitar\" title=\"Adamantine Scimitar\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Adamantine_Scimitar_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Adamantine_Scimitar\" title=\"Adamantine Scimitar\">Adamantine Scimitar</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Immunity to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-slashing\">Slashing</span> is not affected by Lethal Weapon.</li>\n<li>Lethal Weapon works on another equipped slashing weapon while <a href=\"/wiki/Dual_Wielder\" title=\"Dual Wielder\">dual wielding</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Lethal Weapon also works on <a href=\"/wiki/Handaxe\" title=\"Handaxe\">handaxes</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/38px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/50px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thrown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png/25px-Thrown_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Thrown_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thrown\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> from inventory while an adamantine weapon is equipped.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200110\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1682/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16331/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4719/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua me